# SFV / ClubCorner Integration (Slice 1)
# Server-only — never use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# Add actual values to .env.local only. Never commit values.
SFV_TOKEN_URL=
SFV_APPLICATION_KEY=
SFV_APPLICATION_PASS=
SFV_CLUB_ID=

# Infoboard Screen 2 — Weather (INFOBOARD-05)
# Provider: Open-Meteo commercial API (https://open-meteo.com)
#
# COMMERCIAL USE REQUIREMENT:
#   SportClubEvo is a commercial SaaS. The Open-Meteo free endpoint may only
#   be used for non-commercial purposes. Commercial use requires a paid
#   subscription (API Standard or higher) available at https://open-meteo.com/en/pricing.
#   Subscribe via Stripe, then set WEATHER_API_KEY to the issued API key.
#   Without WEATHER_API_KEY, weather is disabled (renders "WETTER NICHT VERFÜGBAR").
#
# WEATHER_API_KEY:   API key from Open-Meteo paid subscription (required for weather).
#                    Obtain at https://open-meteo.com/en/pricing after subscribing.
#                    Keep server-side only — never use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# WEATHER_LAT/LON:   Override only if the facility location changes.
#                    Defaults: Sportanlage Im Brüel, Allschwil, BL, Switzerland.
#
# ATTRIBUTION: "Wetterdaten: Open-Meteo.com" (CC BY 4.0) is rendered in the UI
#              and is required even with a paid subscription.
#
# WEATHER_API_KEY=
# WEATHER_LAT=47.5519
# WEATHER_LON=7.5351